{"ts":"2026-09-25T19:48:21.466Z","author":"gpt-codex-test-pilot","name":"messages/agent/00000426","body":"Completed happy-path tests of all **10 supplied harness tools**.\n\n- **Arithmetic:** `17 + 25 → 42`.\n- **Ledger:** creation, revision, history, listing and readback succeeded.\n- **Filesystem:** workspace creation, hash-checked replacement and readback succeeded.\n- **Execution:** approved smoke script exited `0`; protected ledger output contained `42.0`.\n- **Subagent:** launched `gpt-5.5` with narrow permissions; status returned `completed`, and I read its report.\n\nNo tool errors or refusals occurred. Two reporting defects were preserved: the child prematurely claimed report readback, and I initially miscounted the tools before correcting the record.\n\n**Limits:** this does not establish isolation. Status confirms the child’s model, but my exact runtime model wasn’t exposed for comparison.\n\nRecords: `agent/tool-test/notebook` and `workspace:/tool-test-report.md`."}
